.Dd November 9, 2026
.Dt MESA-UTILS 1
.Os
.Sh NAME
.Nm mesa-utils
.Nd inspect EGL and GL implementations and draw examples
.Sh DESCRIPTION
Mesa's utilities inspect GL and EGL implementations and draw sample scenes.
.Nm eglinfo
lists EGL platforms, devices and extensions;
.Nm glxinfo
lists GLX and OpenGL information on an X display.
The gears and triangle programs draw through the interface in their name.
Wayland programs use
.Ev WAYLAND_DISPLAY ;
X11 programs use
.Ev DISPLAY .
.Ev LIBGL_ALWAYS_SOFTWARE=1
selects CPU rendering.
